Epicenter: `toast` is exported beside `Toaster`, and toasts use rich colors.
A toast reaches a Toaster only through the same svelte-sonner instance, so
apps import both from @epicenter/ui/sonner. Every app's errors and successes read by color, so rich colors
are the kit's default rather than a prop on each app's Toaster.

